+/// How long a press can last and still count as a tap.
+///
+/// Upstream's 250 ms assumes hardware that reports an 80-150 ms tap faithfully.
+/// The Miyoo Mini Flip polls its GPIO buttons and slot times gestures from when
+/// it processes events, so a deliberate press measures around 380 ms here --
+/// measured, in the input trace -- and fell into the gap between this and the
+/// 1 s hold, where the button does nothing at all.
+///
+/// Widened rather than abolished: treating every release as a tap meant a
+/// quick menu opening a third of a second after an eject, and made the
+/// double-tap easy to hit by accident. A press longer than this still does
+/// nothing, which is the lesser of the two annoyances.
+pub const MENU_TAP_MS: Millis = 600;
 pub const MENU_DOUBLE_TAP_MS: Millis = 350;
 pub const MENU_HOLD_MS: Millis = 1000;
 pub const FF_DOUBLE_TAP_MS: Millis = 250;
